= = = House of Representatives (Japan) = = =
The is the lower house of the National Diet of Japan. The House of Councillors is the upper house.
The House of Representatives has 465 members, elected for a four-year term.

= = = House of Councillors (Japan) = = =
The is the upper house of the National Diet of Japan. The House of Representatives is the lower house. 
The House of Councillors has 242 members who each serve six-year terms, two years longer than those of the House of Representatives. Councillors must be at least 30 years old, compared with 25 years old in the House of Representatives.

= = = List of presidents of the House of Councillors (Japan) = = =
