Andersen died on December 29, 2019 in St. George, Utah at the age of 90.

= = = Washington County, Utah = = =
Washington County is a county in the southwestern corner of Utah, United States. As of the 2020 United States Census, the population was 180,279. Its county seat and largest city is St. George. It was named after the first President of the United States, George Washington.

