Haughton is a town in Bossier Parish, Louisiana, United States, it is the suburb of Shreveport. The population was 4,539 at the 2020 census. It is the second most populous municipality in Bossier Parish (after Bossier City)

= = = Oakdale, California = = =
Oakdale is a city in the San Joaquin Valley and Stanislaus County, California. As of the 2020 census, 23,181 people lived there. It is about northeast of Modesto.

