= = = Pure Shores = = =
"Pure Shores" is a 2000 song by the band All Saints and was released on 14 February 2000. It was used in the soundtrack to the 2000 movie "The Beach" and went to number 1 in the United Kingdom, Ireland, Italy, Romania and Scotland and went to number 2 in New Zealand.

= = = Dominicans (Dominica) = = =
Dominicans, are an ethnic group and nation native to Dominica. Most Dominicans are Afro-Dominicans who were brought during the slave trade. The remainder of the population are white Dominicans mostly of French stock, people from the India, and the Caribs.

