Foley is a city in Baldwin County, Alabama, United States. The 2020 census lists the population of the city as 20,335.

= = = Florence, Alabama = = =
Florence is a city in and the county seat of Lauderdale County, Alabama, United States. It is in the northwestern corner of the state.

= = = Florala, Alabama = = =
Florala is a city in Covington County, Alabama, United States. At the 2020 census, the population was 1,923.

